title: "Attention Atlas: An Interactive Course on How Transformers Work"
abstract: "A free, open-source interactive atlas teaching how transformers and large language models work, from vectors and dot products through attention and multi-head mechanisms to full models and LLM pipelines. Thirteen lessons with seven live instruments."
